  unitName: Incubus
  unitId: 60182
  unitNumber: 280
  description: Monsters that prefer living in ruins. Once an Imp grows up it becomes
    an Incubus. They have the reputation of having mean and vulgar personalities,
    and since they relentlessly pester human women they are considered their natural
    enemy. However, women aren't the only ones that an Incubus bothers. They also
    direct their mean acts towards demons like themselves, which has made them hated
    even among their own species.
  summonDesc: You have some cute <br>girls with you, right?<br>I'll help you with
    them!
  fusionDesc: The ladies won't be able to <br>resist this new power of mine!<br>Ah
    ha ha!
  evoDesc: Oh, so that's how it is!<br>Alright then, let me show you<br>one way grown-ups
    have fun!
